# Module layout

This is one Express app. Put the next change in `src/modules/<domain>/` (routes, controller, service, tests together).

- Register mounts only in `src/modules/index.ts` (`registerModules`).
- Do not add new files under `src/controllers` or `src/routes` unless you are shimming an old import.
- Do not change `/api/...` URL paths.
- Do not rewrite the whole repo or extract microservices.
- Gold examples: `src/modules/bible`, `src/modules/engagement`, `src/modules/creators`.
